  "duration": 148.3523125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.3,
      "text": "Have you ever read a passage in English class that only made sense after a few reads?"
    },
    {
      "start": 4.98,
      "end": 5.7,
      "text": "Try this sentence."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.38,
      "end": 8.44,
      "text": "The horse raced past the barn fell."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.16,
      "end": 11.26,
      "text": "On the first read, it doesn't really make sense."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.72,
      "end": 12.76,
      "text": "Did someone forget a word?"
    },
    {
      "start": 13.44,
      "end": 17.1,
      "text": "You hit fell and the whole thought seems to just stop short."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.78,
      "end": 18.68,
      "text": "So you read it again."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.68,
      "end": 20.96,
      "text": "Wait, did a barn fall?"
    },
    {
      "start": 21.5,
      "end": 23.66,
      "text": "Did the horse race past the barn afterward?"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.38,
      "end": 27.24,
      "text": "Your brain tests each possibility against the words."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.24,
      "end": 29.46,
      "text": "Finally, the meaning clicks."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.22,
      "end": 31.98,
      "text": "Someone raced a horse past a barn."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.54,
      "end": 34.12,
      "text": "Then, that same horse fell."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.02,
      "end": 37.32,
      "text": "Each read updates the meaning until it clicks."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.2,
      "end": 39.14,
      "text": "AI does something some more."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.42,
      "end": 41.54,
      "text": "It builds meaning through repeated updates."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.44,
      "end": 44.44,
      "text": "AI doesn't read your message the way you do."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.84,
      "end": 48.76,
      "text": "Instead, it processes your text through a sequential series of layers."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.5,
      "end": 53.72,
      "text": "Information passes forward, with each step building directly on what came before."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.24,
      "end": 56.66,
      "text": "The whole stack of layers is called a neural network."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.4,
      "end": 58.9,
      "text": "Here's how layers operate."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.76,
      "end": 62.18,
      "text": "Numbers go in, update successively, and exit."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.84,
      "end": 64.86,
      "text": "Each row has many numbers, but we'll track two."
    },
    {
      "start": 65.48,
      "end": 70.36,
      "text": "The starting numbers, 0.42 and negative 1.15, shift at every layer."
    },
    {
      "start": 70.82,
      "end": 74.52,
      "text": "By the exit, they update to 0.19 and negative 1.12."
    },
    {
      "start": 76.04,
      "end": 78.22,
      "text": "Attention and transformation drive these updates."
    },
    {
      "start": 78.86,
      "end": 81.36,
      "text": "To see how updating numbers creates contextual meaning,"
    },
    {
      "start": 81.78,
      "end": 83.68,
      "text": "let's track a single word through this process."
    },
    {
      "start": 83.68,
      "end": 87.96,
      "text": "Follow the word, it, as its numbers change from layer to layer."
    },
    {
      "start": 88.54,
      "end": 91.18,
      "text": "The tired cat sat on the mat during the May rainstorm."
    },
    {
      "start": 91.78,
      "end": 92.92,
      "text": "It soon fell asleep."
    },
    {
      "start": 94.04,
      "end": 96.86,
      "text": "Initially, it could refer to the cat, mat, or rainstorm."
    },
    {
      "start": 97.4,
      "end": 100.48,
      "text": "In layer one, numbers shift to connect it to cat."
    },
    {
      "start": 101.16,
      "end": 102.16,
      "text": "Layer two adds detail."
    },
    {
      "start": 102.8,
      "end": 106.58,
      "text": "This repeats, building mathematically until final numbers cement the connection."
    },
    {
      "start": 107.46,
      "end": 110.84,
      "text": "Untangling that simple horse sentence earlier took a few human reads."
    },
    {
      "start": 110.84,
      "end": 114.96,
      "text": "Parsing sarcasm, story twists, or complicated reasoning"
    },
    {
      "start": 114.96,
      "end": 116.82,
      "text": "requires even more work from an AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 117.58,
      "end": 120.34,
      "text": "To handle that complexity, modern models use dozens,"
    },
    {
      "start": 120.66,
      "end": 122.5,
      "text": "and sometimes over a hundred layers."
    },
    {
      "start": 123.04,
      "end": 127.48,
      "text": "This gives the system enough steps to steadily work out those relationships."
    },
    {
      "start": 128.12,
      "end": 130.42,
      "text": "You can't just add infinite layers, though."
    },
    {
      "start": 130.98,
      "end": 135.7,
      "text": "Every additional step requires significantly more computing power and time to run."
    },
    {
      "start": 136.26,
      "end": 138.26,
      "text": "The extra benefit has to be worth the cost."
    },
    {
      "start": 138.26,
      "end": 144.68,
      "text": "Meaning builds up layer by layer, attention and transformation, dozens of times."
    }
  ],
